# 00-project-control/questions/

Open questions and their resolution trail.

| Path                       | Purpose                                          |
| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `open-question-log.md`     | Index of every open and resolved question        |
| `open-questions/open.md`   | Detail view of currently open questions          |
| `open-questions/`          | Individual question files if a question needs depth |
| `resolved/`                | Archived resolved questions                      |

Anti-fiction rule: never guess. If information is missing, log a question.
